{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30647","headline":"及第後上主司王起 · 姚鹄","name":"及第後上主司王起","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"三年竭力向春闱，塞断浮华衆路岐。\n盛选栋梁非昔日，平均雨露及明时。\n登龙旧美无邪径，折桂新荣尽直枝。\n莫道只陪金马贵，相期更在凤皇池。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"姚鹄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30647.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30647","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}